---

🔥 3-LEVEL MEMORY

🟢 Level 1 — Just remember

> Widening = automatic
Narrowing = explicit



🟡 Level 2 — Understand

int → double       Widening
double → int       Narrowing
Dog → Animal       Upcasting
Animal → Dog       Downcasting

🔴 Level 3 — Master

> Widening may still lose precision in some numeric conversions; narrowing may lose information or overflow; downcasting is checked against the actual runtime object and can throw ClassCastException.




